{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01332-s02","batch":1332,"shard":2,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":40,"shard_end_exclusive":60,"translated_count":10,"entries":[{"uid":"zhcn:9c52090964bff0a27cbd16ab","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"很可爱的徽章吧？是我亲手做的哦♪","source_fingerprint":"41491e3a6198033c3520a0b14029d03d0b3e2bd07287a40cb0b810322d10c877","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","70217"],"entry_index":40,"target_text":"Huy hiệu dễ thương lắm đúng không? Falco tự tay làm đấy♪","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:11c3dea6dfb6f32a4e5254af","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"对于马娘偶像而言，\n制服是必须的呢。","source_fingerprint":"2d7b159ca211fc831c0aa3deeef40c9217a172021b9d16c849c855efe210c150","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71004"],"entry_index":41,"target_text":"Với một idol Mã Nương,\nđồng phục là thứ không thể thiếu đâu.","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:bee8780678aa43a9fd0e380a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"轻飘飘的衣服，很可爱呢～！\n和飞鹰子很搭哦！","source_fingerprint":"a49747e7a8dc925bf5795968ce9918d880e108709b1a2d19e1bb090e7468c706","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71008"],"entry_index":42,"target_text":"Bộ đồ nhẹ bồng bềnh này dễ thương quá～!\nHợp với Falco lắm luôn!","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:cc606855174126f4e69564db","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"又可爱又健康的设计，\n这就是马娘偶像应有的感觉呢！","source_fingerprint":"78985613ea0ef77aaf94ef091f0d019925e2e582cd5e23fc7cb51f1f48bea094","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71009"],"entry_index":43,"target_text":"Thiết kế vừa dễ thương vừa khỏe khoắn,\nđúng chất idol Mã Nương luôn nhỉ!","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:af39a429b0824bd7d319d195","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"怎么啦怎么啦？制服没有皱巴巴的吧？\n身为马娘偶像，可得随时注意仪容呢。","source_fingerprint":"33b2accf0d7f18d4e19dfc3722585e2089319b23149be708cd211e1883cdf38d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71010"],"entry_index":44,"target_text":"Sao thế, sao thế? Đồng phục không bị nhăn chứ?\nLà idol Mã Nương thì lúc nào cũng phải chú ý vẻ ngoài mà.","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:6f073cd42a569b345f624222","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"一定要好好上舞蹈课，\n就算是C位也不能怯场呢！","source_fingerprint":"496f6bd3be8860f4eec2beddf109e8c3d06b46e77e129983e1a086e214628483","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71014"],"entry_index":45,"target_text":"Phải học vũ đạo thật chăm,\ndù đứng center cũng không được khớp đâu!","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:022e08bf9c490fd4a76f0541","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎嘿嘿……一见钟情了嘛？\n这是独属于飞鹰子的衣服哦☆","source_fingerprint":"6b2e30ed97901c62b26f41b2899bfc8254c7029754188a35730593beebd04b13","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71015"],"entry_index":46,"target_text":"Ehehe…… yêu từ cái nhìn đầu tiên rồi à?\nĐây là bộ đồ chỉ riêng Falco mới có đấy☆","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:e2e62a4927a48df27a79888a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"噔噔噔☆\r\n如何？飞鹰子也有帅气的一面哦♪","source_fingerprint":"766518c8aa52a40cb10c7a0125c5399606ed8fe6e9c6f57116e5c37e04e75c41","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71016"],"entry_index":47,"target_text":"Ta-da-da☆\r\nThế nào? Falco cũng có một mặt thật ngầu đấy♪","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:f12f4532f69a30cc97bba411","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"即便满身泥泞，\r\n这份光辉也绝不会被掩盖！","source_fingerprint":"7f523e9ec9eeee6b93a13fba7d476afd3e11d1394685f6f6c0497e6ad961be13","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71017"],"entry_index":48,"target_text":"Dù có lấm lem bùn đất,\r\nánh sáng này cũng tuyệt đối không thể bị che lấp!","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:f54c268bcac6173947688771","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"飞鹰子超可爱的哦♪","source_fingerprint":"f4ae35e2d57eb815245272c28d195fde24c726fb992bfbe0ffd86298d29e8661","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1046","71018"],"entry_index":49,"target_text":"Falco siêu dễ thương đấy♪","reviewed":true}]}